From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:59:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): clarify Bake table coordinates

Describe Bake as table coordinates relative to the work offset origin.
Tell the operator not to add controller rotation and pin the label with
nonzero-yaw posted coordinates.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2359
